  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "野生囡仔時"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span><b>作者：</b></span></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>林榮淑&nbsp;&nbsp;</b></span></p><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">農業社會，人人tuè日頭作穡。天一下光，大人就出門sì-kè走tsông，辛苦趁食，ǹg望厝內kánn-ná肉粽kuānn ê囡仔穿ē燒、食ē飽。無憂無愁ê囡仔tuè日頭sì-kè sńg，人人擋bē tiâu厝外天kuân地闊ê呼喚。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">庄跤囡仔是大自然ê寵兒，無分查埔查某，厝邊隔壁m̄免事先約定，逐家同齊出現。阿兄tshuā小弟、阿姊牽小妹，細漢--ê jiok大漢--ê，大漢--ê āinn iáu bē-hiáu行路--ê，隨個人ê興趣tshit-thô。揣一个空地仔，踢毽子、拍kan-lo̍k、跳索仔、sńg竹銃、tshiáng跤雞、踢罐仔、ī沙包仔、ī珠仔、搧尪仔標……。&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">島嶼秀麗ê農村，稻仔田、水圳、竹林、廟宇kap古早起ê農家厝……，交織一个kap世界無爭恬靜ê天地。藍綠ê水tī圳溝內khuann-khuann仔流，兩爿草仔kuân差不多beh拄到跤頭趺，tsit款所在平常時罕得有人ē來。只要用跤kā tín動--一-下，隨跳出一大堆肥koh大隻ê草蜢仔、sih-sut仔、草猴、杜伯仔……等等天然ê獵物，hōo人掠bē了、sńg bē完。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">便若有樹仔、有草仔ê所在，樹林、山坡、野地sì-kè lóng bih大大細細、奇奇怪怪ê蟲thuā。對無禁無忌，愛sńg khah刺激活動ê查埔囡仔，koh-khah好tshit-thô。Khiú大欉榕仔ê喙鬚幌來幌去，日--時掠田嬰、蝴蝶，beh暗仔掠火金蛄。Peh樹仔掠蟬、金龜……，挽龍眼、土菝仔、土檨仔……，食野果止iau兼止喙ta。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">揣sih-sut仔ê塗空灌杜猴。掀石頭仔，píng磚仔角揣杜蚓仔，提tńg去kā厝內底飼ê鴨仔、鵝仔加菜；iah是提去溪邊釣魚，踮水田、水溝、水草岸邊釣四跤仔，kā厝內ê人加菜。對家計tàu-sann-kāng，ke減得著序大人呵咾。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">就是án-ne，雙跤踏塗沙ê囡仔，規年thàng天、規工放浪青山綠水。提青山做畫布、提綠水做彩筆，自由自在彩繪童年，悠遊天kap地之間，生活就是教育，娛樂也是教育。大自然是一間學校，田園野外是教室，歲頭仔排tī家己頭前--ê lóng是老師，生活是教材。Tsit款野生ê囡仔時，tsit款活跳跳ê囡仔時，21世紀出世ê囡仔聽--著，是m̄是感覺leh眠夢--leh？&nbsp; &nbsp;</span></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjMCzXzzPXozYCLySU91DrZOYmFEoT1E5cubpH_QXapHcxNwRbqPf8AaK4pSo1j4mV1CkA6C67q2pJOWpth3LrXsnCj45xnTogQUTlppHBhxEA-zOhUcQ1EwUEjXQvtcT0mTlgAlRSadye6H0aY4lA18Eh11AkxQb8DI9jk2EM-fK2jYai4wEnaNjalbw/s1421/342%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1421\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjMCzXzzPXozYCLySU91DrZOYmFEoT1E5cubpH_QXapHcxNwRbqPf8AaK4pSo1j4mV1CkA6C67q2pJOWpth3LrXsnCj45xnTogQUTlppHBhxEA-zOhUcQ1EwUEjXQvtcT0mTlgAlRSadye6H0aY4lA18Eh11AkxQb8DI9jk2EM-fK2jYai4wEnaNjalbw/w450-h640/342%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgVKAtex6YAPIjgYN_diHvtLXY2iOnoddGjMBNFP9ZpIoPqWeFWAdqCO5XIXdLCB5qFhSOF0bzOM8mOTaL5f87NCTc_4urlS1IA_uY0m-M75JsZfvX2f9hCMOZdPa88YoJiv1x8lVNKIYOm9s3guhJ7GDL5bbKzRycno9AWOoDNNGrEUDx3spNrphofKw/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1342%E6%9C%9F_014.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgVKAtex6YAPIjgYN_diHvtLXY2iOnoddGjMBNFP9ZpIoPqWeFWAdqCO5XIXdLCB5qFhSOF0bzOM8mOTaL5f87NCTc_4urlS1IA_uY0m-M75JsZfvX2f9hCMOZdPa88YoJiv1x8lVNKIYOm9s3guhJ7GDL5bbKzRycno9AWOoDN